    <title>Vol.15 【2024】看电影的这一年，年终闲聊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67742f341e823e72d34efdeb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67742f341e823e72d34efdeb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>告别2024~我们几个作为影视up主，就一起盘盘今年看过的那些电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span>闲聊为主，就不搞什么十佳十烂的评选了~和大家一起，一个月一个月慢慢唠，重拾2024这一年关于电影的记忆！那话不多说，咱们人齐走菜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 年终盘点终于录上了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 一月，整体冷清，更多是上一年年末作品的延续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 二月，春节档大战！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> 三月，意外杀出的爆款让档期不冷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">39:14</a> 四月，宫崎骏撑起一片天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2965">49:25</a> 五月，热闹的五一档</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3378">56:18</a> 六月，不断调整预期的观影月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3877">1:04:37</a> 七月，暑期档正式开启！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4090">1:08:10</a> 八月，“高质量低票房”的暑期档</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4262">1:11:02</a> 九月，戛纳话题之作揭开面纱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4474">1:14:34</a> 十月，又一大档期乱战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4848">1:20:48</a> 十一月，今年最热议国产电影诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5181">1:26:21</a> 十二月，年末岁尾，又到了期待元旦新片的时候~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6542">1:49:02</a> 年终总结~更多对电影的细致讨论，欢迎大家翻阅我们的往期作品！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢听众姥爷们一年来的陪伴和支持，明年雅间励志录更多节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期完结，大家新年快乐！！！撒花！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>6号雅间里边请~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是五位中年影视up主的唠嗑包间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>就等你了，咱们人齐了走菜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>关上门，放松心态，一起唠唠影娱综和生活里七七八八的那些事！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【常驻嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@培根悖论唠唠嗑</span></p><span></span><p><span>@迷影至下Filmlast</span></p><span></span><p><span>@刘老师说电影</span></p>]]></description>
